config INTEL_IDXD_VFIO
	tristate "Intel DSA SIOV VFIO work queue support"
	depends on INTEL_IDXD
	depends on INTEL_IDXD_SVM
	depends on VFIO_DEVICE_CDEV
	depends on IOMMUFD
	select VFIO_PCI_CORE
	help
	  This driver provides the VFIO PCI side of Intel(R) DSA
	  virtualization support. It is intended to expose selected IDXD
	  work queues to userspace as VFIO devices while the IDXD core driver
	  owns accelerator discovery and configuration.

	  To compile this as a module, choose M here: the module will be
	  called idxd_vfio_pci.
